{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"node-1","type":"text","text":"# Aquila API Routes\n\nBase URL: `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL}`","x":-540,"y":-320,"width":400,"height":180},
		{"id":"node-auth","type":"text","text":"## Authentication\n\n### User Login\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/auth/login`\n- **Auth**: Public\n- **Body**: `{ identifier, password }` (JSON)","x":-2170,"y":-40,"width":450,"height":250},
		{"id":"node-api-key","type":"text","text":"## API Key Management\n\n### Get API Keys\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/api-key`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Create API Key\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/api-key`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ name }` (JSON)\n\n### Regenerate API Key\n- **Method**: `PUT`\n- **URL**: `/api-key`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ id }` (JSON)\n\n### Delete API Key\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/api-key/:id`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":-2170,"y":250,"width":450,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-connections","type":"text","text":"## Connections\n\n### Find All Connections\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/connections`\n- **Query Params**: `linkedTo` (optional, e.g. BOT, WEBSITE)\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Save Connection\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/connections/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ provider, linkedUsername?, accessToken?, refreshToken?, expiresAt?, connectionId?, username?, linkedTo? }` (JSON)\n\n### Remove Connection\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/connections/remove/:provider`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ username? }` (JSON)\n\n### Initiate OAuth\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/connections/:provider/connect`\n- **Query Params**: `token` (JWT), `redirectUrl` (string)\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### OAuth Callback\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/connections/:provider/callback`\n- **Query Params**: `code`, `state` (token)\n- **Auth**: Public (uses state token internally)","x":-1600,"y":-40,"width":450,"height":450},
		{"id":"node-media","type":"text","text":"## Media Upload & Retrieval\n\n### Upload File\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/media/upload`\n- **Auth**: Required (multipart/form-data)\n- **Body**: `file` (Binary image up to 4MB; jpg, png, gif)\n\n### Retrieve File\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/media/image/:filename`\n- **Auth**: Public","x":-1600,"y":450,"width":450,"height":350},
		{"id":"node-anime","type":"text","text":"## Anime\n\n### Search Anime\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/anime/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Anime Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/anime/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":-820,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-list-anime","type":"text","text":"## List Management (Anime)\n\n### Get User List\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/user/:username`\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Entry\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/entry/:animeId`\n- **Auth**: Required (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`)\n\n### Save Entry\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/entry/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ animeId, status?, progress?, score?, startDate?, endDate?, notes?, rewatched?, updateConnection?, connections? }` (JSON)\n\n### Delete Entry\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/list/anime/entry/:animeId`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":-870,"y":550,"width":450,"height":770},
		{"id":"node-manga","type":"text","text":"## Manga\n\n### Search Manga\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/manga/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Manga Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/manga/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":-340,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-list-manga","type":"text","text":"## List Management (Manga)\n\n### Get User List\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/user/:username`\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Entry\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/entry/:mangaId`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Save Entry\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/entry/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ mangaId, status?, chapters?, volumes?, score?, startDate?, endDate?, notes?, reread?, updateConnection?, connections? }` (JSON)\n\n### Delete Entry\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/list/manga/entry/:mangaId`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":-390,"y":550,"width":450,"height":770},
		{"id":"node-movie","type":"text","text":"## Movie\n\n### Search Movie\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/movie/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Movie Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/movie/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":150,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-list-movie","type":"text","text":"## List Management (Movie)\n\n### Get User List\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/movie/user/:username`\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Entry\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/movie/entry/:tvdbId`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Save Entry\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/movie/entry/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ tvdbId, status?, score?, startDate?, endDate?, notes?, rewatched?, updateConnection?, connections? }` (JSON)\n\n### Delete Entry\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/list/movie/entry/:tvdbId`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":90,"y":550,"width":450,"height":770},
		{"id":"node-tv","type":"text","text":"## TV\n\n### Search TV\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/tv/search`\n- **Query Params**: `name` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get TV Details\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/tv/details/:id`\n- **Params**: `id` (string)\n- **Auth**: Public","x":620,"y":-40,"width":350,"height":490},
		{"id":"node-list-tv","type":"text","text":"## List Management (TV)\n\n### Get User List\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/tv/user/:username`\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Entry\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/tv/entry/:tvdbId`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Save Entry\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/tv/entry/save`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ tvdbId, status?, score?, startDate?, endDate?, notes?, rewatched?, updateConnection?, connections? }` (JSON)\n\n### Delete Entry\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/list/tv/entry/:tvdbId`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":570,"y":550,"width":450,"height":770},
		{"id":"node-list-general","type":"text","text":"## List Utilities & Tracking\n\n### Get Watching List\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/list/watching`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Increment Progress\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/increment`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ mediaType: 'anime' | 'manga' | 'tv', id: number }` (JSON)\n\n### Toggle Episode Watched\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/tv/entry/:tvdbId/episode`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ seasonNum, episodeNum }` (JSON)\n\n### Toggle Season Watched\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/list/tv/entry/:tvdbId/season`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ seasonNum, episodes: any[], watched: boolean }` (JSON)","x":1050,"y":550,"width":450,"height":770},
		{"id":"node-favorites","type":"text","text":"## Favorites Management\n\n### Get Favorites\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/favorites`\n- **Query Params**: `type` (optional, e.g. ANIME, MANGA, MOVIE, TV, BOOK, USER)\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Get User Favorites\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/favorites/user/:username`\n- **Query Params**: `type` (optional)\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Favorite Status\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/favorites/status/:type/:mediaId`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Add Favorite\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/favorites`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ type, mediaId }` (JSON)\n\n### Remove Favorite\n- **Method**: `DELETE`\n- **URL**: `/favorites/:type/:mediaId`\n- **Auth**: Required","x":1660,"y":-40,"width":450,"height":650},
		{"id":"node-user","type":"text","text":"## User Profile & Settings\n\n### Create User (Register)\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **URL**: `/user/create`\n- **Auth**: Public\n- **Body**: `{ email, username, password }` (JSON)\n\n### Get User Profile\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/user/:username`\n- **Auth**: Public\n\n### Get Privacy Settings\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **URL**: `/user/privacy`\n- **Auth**: Required\n\n### Update Privacy Settings\n- **Method**: `PUT`\n- **URL**: `/user/privacy`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ profile?, animeList?, mangaList?, tvList?, movieList? }` (JSON)\n\n### Update Profile Settings\n- **Method**: `PUT`\n- **URL**: `/user/settings`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ profileSettings }` (JSON)\n\n### Update User Info\n- **Method**: `PUT`\n- **URL**: `/user/update`\n- **Auth**: Required\n- **Body**: `{ displayName?, email?, currentPassword?, newPassword?, avatarUrl?, bannerUrl? }` (JSON)","x":1050,"y":-320,"width":450,"height":750}
	],
	"edges":[]
}